## F-01: DNS Zone Transfer Unrestricted

**Severity:** Medium | **CVSS:** 5.3 (AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:N)

ISC BIND is configured with `allow-transfer { any; };`, allowing any host to request a full copy of the zone. A single `dig axfr` call returns all DNS records including `preprod-payroll.trick.htb`, a subdomain not otherwise discoverable.

**Remediation:** Restrict zone transfers to authorised secondary nameserver IPs only: `allow-transfer { <secondary-ns-ip>; };`. Audit all DNS zones for records that expose internal infrastructure.

